  "body": "The native post in #2951 selects a single resident quality. Give the operator an explicit second choice for 20 mm cold die steel and Berco Cut 0.25 mm wire.\n\nThe Agie-CAM catalog lists a Fine+ quality with Ra 0.35 micrometres. The offline control accepted its requested Ra 0.35, Te 1.5 and Tkm 1.0 values. The synthetic job ran a main cut and three trims. Its straight-face offsets matched those of the existing Ra 0.30 job. The catalog pass estimate differed from the plotted work.\n\nKeep the current selection as the default. Save the operator's choice in the project and show it in the normal operation workflow. Validate the stock height, wire and material before creating the job. Verify both selections on fresh CAMCraft jobs. Record requested quality separately from measured motion and achieved surface finish.\n\nSuggested labels are P6, effort:high, area:post, enhancement and source:agent.\n",
